    "detailed_description": "Walk on the walls and ceiling as you solve physics puzzles, progressing through a series a test chambers. Push boxes and use them in combination with your rotation abilities to reach new areas.<br><br>Make your escape to the outside world\u2014but your journey doesn\u2019t end there. Use your abilities to traverse the massive underground facility and uncover its dark secrets.<br><br>The game will also include a feature-rich level editor (not yet implemented), and an original soundtrack by Criobite.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055510/extras/7e1bc07765d00bab169f3ab1999fddac.avif?t=1688487420\" /></div><br><br><strong>Rotate: Collective</strong> is an expanded retelling of the popular web game \u201cRotate\u201d with re-imagined gameplay, introducing new puzzle mechanics for even more mind-bending challenges!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2055510/extras/c160070a548cff12c36efc8eab688696.avif?t=1688487420\" /></div>",
